(text "Use all GP0..GP7 as INPUTS, including channels currently used as outputs.\nThe output driver controls external pins; this expander only reads their actual state.\nInput transistor stages invert polarity: set IPOL = 0xFF, or invert in MCU software.\nEnable interrupt-on-change for input channels only; mask PWM/output channels.\nINT goes to STM32 PA3 / EXTI3. SPI address straps A1=A0=0.\nSeparate chip selects: never select U5 and U6 simultaneously.\nUse a conservative shared SPI clock (e.g. 1 MHz); configure mode separately per device.\nNo firmware is supplied in this schematic package." (at 20 215 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top) ) (uuid "b82ab151-40d0-4d2b-943b-ef61aa7e46b1")) (embedded_fonts no))
